        <summary>
          <para>Full range uses all values for Y, Cb and Cr from 0 to 2^b-1, where b is the bit depth of the color format.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/DataSpace#RANGE_FULL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.DataSpace.RANGE_FULL</code>.</a></format></para>
